  {
    "name": "FILEN-031: an on-demand file cache is bounded and pushes back instead of filling the disk",
    "description": "FILEN-031 (Filen): the network drive's write cache filled the local SSD. Rule P13 (a cache is bounded and pushes back), E3. sync-chaos placeholder-write-back (pending).",
